    <string name="help_title">How it works</string>
    <string name="help_message">AdbClipboard syncs your clipboard between this device and your PC over ADB.\n\n• PC to Android: copy something on your PC and it appears here automatically.\n• Android to PC: tap the floating bubble to send this device\'s clipboard to your PC.\n\nThe bubble: tap to sync, drag to move, pinch to resize, double-tap to hide. If you hide it, tap the notification to bring it back.\n\nKeep adb_clipboard_sync.py running on your PC, and update it to the latest version so the connection status keeps working.</string>

